OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOften cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Fdrizzle, chiefly across the high
OL,7,Fground. Cloud lifting and breaking
OL,8,Fsomewhat by the afternoon. Some bright
OL,9,For sunny spells possible, most likely
OL,10,Facross southern counties. Another
OL,11,Frather warm and humid day ahead.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA band of cloud and rain will
OL,14,Farrive across the region from the
OL,15,Fnorth, some heavier bursts possible.
OL,16,FWinds becoming gusty for a time. Rain
OL,17,Fclearing southwards towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
