OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry and bright start to the
OL,6,Fday, with sunny spells. Scattered
OL,7,Fshowers arriving from the northwest
OL,8,Fduring the day. Feeling fresher than
OL,9,Frecent days.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable over the next few days and
OL,13,Ffeeling fresher. Sunshine and showers
OL,14,Fwill spread across the region, and it
OL,15,Fwill turn increasingly windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
